G1 Z14 F720 ; Move print head up
G1 X178 Y178 F4200 ; park print head
G1 Z42 F720 ; Move print head further up
G4 ; wait
M104 S0 ; turn off temperature
M140 S0 ; turn off heatbed
M107 ; turn off fan
M221 S100 ; reset flow
M900 K0 ; reset LA
M84 ; disable motors
; max_layer_z = 12
M73 P100 R0
; filament used [mm] = 1473.28
